150
00:04:36,633 --> 00:04:37,272
Trap one.

151
00:04:37,452 --> 00:04:38,996
I'll start when I earn more.

152
00:04:39,176 --> 00:04:40,674
It feels logical.

153
00:04:40,854 --> 00:04:43,154
Why invest fifty dollars when you could

154
00:04:43,154 --> 00:04:45,219
