155
00:04:45,399 --> 00:04:46,451
But as we just saw,

156
00:04:46,451 --> 00:04:48,555
those early dollars have the most time

157
00:04:48,555 --> 00:04:48,998
to grow.

158
00:04:49,178 --> 00:04:51,304
And people who wait for the perfect

159
00:04:51,304 --> 00:04:53,915
