160
00:04:53,915 --> 00:04:55,979
their pay, so the right time never

161
00:04:55,979 --> 00:04:56,829
seems to come.

162
00:04:57,179 --> 00:04:57,911
Trap two.

163
00:04:58,091 --> 00:04:59,623
Keeping up with your friends.

164
00:04:59,803 --> 00:05:02,235
Your twenties are full of weddings,

165
00:05:02,235 --> 00:05:04,180
trips, dinners and concerts.

166
00:05:04,360 --> 00:05:07,205
Social media shows you everyone's highlights.

167
00:05:07,385 --> 00:05:09,405
It's easy to spend to stay included.

168
00:05:09,585 --> 00:05:11,343
But you only see their spending,

169
00:05:11,343 --> 00:05:13,265
never their credit card statements.

170
00:05:13,445 --> 00:05:15,169
Many of them are just as stressed

171
00:05:15,169 --> 00:05:15,535
as you.

172
00:05:15,885 --> 00:05:16,977
Trap three.

173
00:05:17,157 --> 00:05:19,014
The first real paycheck upgrade.

174
00:05:19,194 --> 00:05:20,981
After years as a student,

175
00:05:20,981 --> 00:05:23,339
your first salary feels enormous.

176
00:05:23,519 --> 00:05:26,483
The temptation is to upgrade everything at

177
00:05:26,483 --> 00:05:27,612
