180
00:05:30,967 --> 00:05:32,976
Each upgrade feels deserved.

181
00:05:33,156 --> 00:05:35,292
Together, they can lock in high fixed

182
00:05:35,292 --> 00:05:37,486
costs before you've built any cushion.

183
00:05:37,836 --> 00:05:38,661
Trap four.

184
00:05:38,841 --> 00:05:40,710
Thinking investing is gambling.

185
00:05:40,890 --> 00:05:43,660
Many people in their twenties grew up

186
00:05:43,660 --> 00:05:46,954
watching crashes, scams and crypto booms and

187
00:05:46,954 --> 00:05:47,403
busts.

188
00:05:47,583 --> 00:05:49,649
So they keep everything in a checking

189
00:05:49,649 --> 00:05:51,101
account, which feels safe.

190
00:05:51,281 --> 00:05:52,586
But over decades,

191
00:05:52,586 --> 00:05:55,426
cash loses buying power to inflation.

192
00:05:55,606 --> 00:05:58,636
Diversified, long term investing in low cost

193
00:05:58,636 --> 00:06:01,321
funds is very different from betting on

194
00:06:01,321 --> 00:06:02,630
a single hot stock.

195
00:06:02,979 --> 00:06:04,210
And trap five.

196
00:06:04,390 --> 00:06:05,933
Thinking it's too late,

197
00:06:05,933 --> 00:06:06,805
or too early.

198
00:06:06,985 --> 00:06:09,851
Some twenty somethings feel they're already behind

199
00:06:09,851 --> 00:06:12,028
because they see people their age with

200
