205
00:06:20,888 --> 00:06:23,270
And doing nothing is the most expensive

206
00:06:23,270 --> 00:06:23,698
choice.

207
00:06:24,047 --> 00:06:25,731
So what mindset works?

208
00:06:25,911 --> 00:06:27,944
Think of your twenties as building the

209
00:06:27,944 --> 00:06:28,372
machine.

210
00:06:28,552 --> 00:06:29,903
You're not trying to get rich in

211
00:06:29,903 --> 00:06:30,410
this decade.

212
00:06:30,590 --> 00:06:33,315
You're building the systems that will make

213
00:06:33,315 --> 00:06:34,483
you wealthy later:

214
00:06:34,483 --> 00:06:36,754
automatic savings, low fixed costs,

215
00:06:36,754 --> 00:06:37,857
a growing income,

216
00:06:37,857 --> 00:06:40,388
good credit, and the habit of investing

217
00:06:40,388 --> 00:06:41,166
every month.

218
00:06:41,516 --> 00:06:44,000
Another helpful idea is to give your

219
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:46,207
future self a seat at the table.

220
00:06:46,387 --> 00:06:47,834
Before a big purchase,

221
00:06:47,834 --> 00:06:49,874
