223
00:06:51,106 --> 00:06:53,428
Sometimes the answer is yes.

224
00:06:53,608 --> 00:06:54,844
A trip with friends,

225
00:06:54,844 --> 00:06:56,882
a course that boosts your career.

226
00:06:57,062 --> 00:06:58,363
Sometimes it's no.

227
00:06:58,543 --> 00:07:00,911
That simple question can save you thousands.

228
00:07:01,261 --> 00:07:03,701
And finally, give yourself room to make

229
00:07:03,701 --> 00:07:04,640
small mistakes.

230
00:07:04,820 --> 00:07:07,165
Your twenties are when mistakes are cheapest.

231
00:07:07,345 --> 00:07:09,200
Overspending on one trip,

232
00:07:09,200 --> 00:07:11,425
