235
00:07:14,572 --> 00:07:17,007
What matters is the overall direction,

236
00:07:17,007 --> 00:07:18,160
and learning fast.

237
00:07:18,509 --> 00:07:19,392
Angle three.

238
00:07:19,572 --> 00:07:20,268
The playbook.

239
00:07:20,448 --> 00:07:22,097
Twenty moves for your twenties.

240
00:07:22,277 --> 00:07:23,660
You don't need to do them all

241
00:07:23,660 --> 00:07:24,042
at once.

242
00:07:24,222 --> 00:07:25,766
Pick a few each year.

243
00:07:26,115 --> 00:07:26,812
Move one.

244
00:07:26,992 --> 00:07:28,675
Know where your money goes.

245
00:07:29,025 --> 00:07:30,651
Track every dollar for one month.

246
00:07:30,831 --> 00:07:32,196
Use your bank app,

247
00:07:32,196 --> 00:07:34,395
a spreadsheet, or a notebook.

248
00:07:34,575 --> 00:07:35,980
Don't change anything yet.

249
00:07:36,160 --> 00:07:37,112
Just watch.

250
00:07:37,292 --> 00:07:39,943
Most people are surprised by at least

251
00:07:39,943 --> 00:07:42,379
one category, often food delivery,

252
00:07:42,379 --> 00:07:44,386
subscriptions or rideshares.

253
00:07:44,735 --> 00:07:47,706
Then sort your spending into three groups:

254
00:07:47,706 --> 00:07:50,393
