266
00:08:14,511 --> 00:08:17,868
accounts protect deposits up to legal limits.

267
00:08:18,048 --> 00:08:20,317
It takes about ten minutes and gives

268
00:08:20,317 --> 00:08:22,019
your savings a better home.

269
00:08:22,368 --> 00:08:23,482
Give it a name,

270
00:08:23,482 --> 00:08:26,153
like Emergency Fund or Freedom Fund.

271
00:08:26,333 --> 00:08:27,414
It sounds silly,

272
00:08:27,414 --> 00:08:30,928
but research in behavioral economics suggests people

273
00:08:30,928 --> 00:08:33,225
are less likely to raid money that

274
00:08:33,225 --> 00:08:34,576
has a clear purpose.

275
00:08:34,756 --> 00:08:36,372
Keep it at a different bank from

276
00:08:36,372 --> 00:08:38,341
your checking account if that helps you

277
00:08:38,341 --> 00:08:39,099
leave it alone.

278
00:08:39,448 --> 00:08:40,412
Move three.

279
00:08:40,592 --> 00:08:42,659
Build a starter emergency fund.

280
00:08:43,008 --> 00:08:45,678
Save one thousand dollars as fast as

281
00:08:45,678 --> 00:08:46,271
